{"page":444,"width":1735,"height":2598,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"11.4 오류 감지 및 수정","words":[{"text":"11.4","x":1131,"y":158,"width":63,"height":23},{"text":"오류","x":1209,"y":159,"width":46,"height":25},{"text":"감지","x":1264,"y":158,"width":44,"height":26},{"text":"및","x":1319,"y":158,"width":21,"height":26},{"text":"수정","x":1349,"y":158,"width":47,"height":26}]},{"text":"수 있도록 하는 것이다. 이 빙卜법은 14.5.6절에서 자세히 설명한다.","words":[{"text":"수","x":283,"y":285,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"있도록","x":331,"y":286,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"하는","x":440,"y":287,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":515,"y":286,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":629,"y":286,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"빙卜법은","x":670,"y":287,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"14.5.6절에서","x":769,"y":287,"width":172,"height":36},{"text":"자세히","x":957,"y":286,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"설명한다.","x":1061,"y":286,"width":132,"height":37}]},{"text":"505","words":[{"text":"505","x":1469,"y":154,"width":59,"height":29}]},{"text":"가비지 수집이 성능에 미치는 영향을 자세히 살펴보자. 임의 읽기 및 쓰기 부하를 처","words":[{"text":"가비지","x":348,"y":346,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"수집이","x":456,"y":347,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"성능에","x":564,"y":346,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"미치는","x":668,"y":346,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"영향을","x":769,"y":347,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"자세히","x":867,"y":347,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":969,"y":347,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"임의","x":1117,"y":346,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"읽기","x":1192,"y":346,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"및","x":1268,"y":347,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"쓰기","x":1309,"y":347,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"부하를","x":1387,"y":347,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"처","x":1498,"y":349,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"리 중인 NVM 장치를 고려하자. 모든 블록이 기록되었지만 시용 기능한 여유 공간이 있","words":[{"text":"리","x":289,"y":406,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"중인","x":331,"y":407,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"NVM","x":408,"y":410,"width":92,"height